{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/mollie-components-2-ios-sdk.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents"},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Accept card payments in your iOS app with a drop-in, PCI-aware payment UI — card tokenization, 3D Secure, and theming behind a single import.","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"module","roleHeading":"Framework","role":"collection","title":"MollieComponents","modules":[{"name":"MollieComponents"}],"externalID":"MollieComponents"},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/mollie-components-2-ios-sdk.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/GettingStarted","doc:\/\/mollie-components-2-ios-sdk.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentSheet"],"anchor":"Getting-Started","title":"Getting Started"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/mollie-components-2-ios-sdk.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentSheet","doc:\/\/mollie-components-2-ios-sdk.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentCardFormView"],"anchor":"Presenting","title":"Presenting"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/mollie-components-2-ios-sdk.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentResult","doc:\/\/mollie-components-2-ios-sdk.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePayment"],"anchor":"Results","title":"Results"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/mollie-components-2-ios-sdk.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/Theming"],"anchor":"Customizing-appearance","title":"Customizing appearance"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/mollie-components-2-ios-sdk.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentEndpoints"],"anchor":"Configuration","title":"Configuration"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/mollie-components-2-ios-sdk.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/HandlingErrors"],"anchor":"Handling-Errors","title":"Handling Errors"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/mollie-components-2-ios-sdk.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/SwiftUICore"],"anchor":"Extended-Modules","title":"Extended Modules"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MollieComponents"},{"text":" is the merchant-facing entry point to the Mollie Components iOS SDK. You present a payment surface — modal or embedded — hand it a server-issued client access token, and receive a single typed ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/mollie-components-2-ios-sdk.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentResult"},{"text":" describing how the flow ended. The card number and CVC the cardholder types are captured inside Mollie’s own UI and tokenized over TLS; they never cross the documented SDK boundary into your code. Your ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onResult"},{"text":" callback receives only session metadata, never raw card data.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"3D Secure is handled for you. When the issuer requires a challenge, the SDK presents the authentication WebView, drives it to a terminal state, and folds the outcome back into the same "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/mollie-components-2-ios-sdk.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentResult","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" you already handle — there is no separate 3DS callback to wire up."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"style":"important","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The SDK runs inside your app’s process. UIKit provides no platform-level isolation between your code and the SDK, so the protection of typed card data is "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"contractual, not platform-enforced"}]},{"type":"text","text":". Read "},{"code":"SECURITY.md","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" at the repository root for the full trust model — what the SDK defends against, what it cannot enforce, and the integration practices your team must follow."}]}],"name":"Important","type":"aside"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"To get going in a few lines, see ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/mollie-components-2-ios-sdk.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/GettingStarted","type":"reference"},{"text":". To restyle the sheet to match your brand, see ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/mollie-components-2-ios-sdk.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/Theming","type":"reference"},{"text":". To map every outcome the SDK can hand back to merchant-facing behavior, see ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/mollie-components-2-ios-sdk.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/HandlingErrors","type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/molliecomponents"]}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"references":{"doc://mollie-components-2-ios-sdk.MollieComponents/documentation/MollieComponents/HandlingErrors":{"role":"article","title":"Handling Errors","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Map every outcome the payment sheet can hand back to merchant-facing behavior."}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/molliecomponents\/handlingerrors","kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/mollie-components-2-ios-sdk.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/HandlingErrors"},"doc://mollie-components-2-ios-sdk.MollieComponents/documentation/MollieComponents/MolliePaymentEndpoints":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/mollie-components-2-ios-sdk.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentEndpoints","abstract":[{"text":"Override the Mollie service endpoints the payment sheet routes through.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/molliecomponents\/mo